This game serves a critical purpose: proving to students that AI is ALREADY in their everyday lives, not some distant future concept.

SAY: &quot;I&apos;m going to show you 6 things. For each one — shout AI or NOT AI as loud as you can. First person to shout gets a point. Ready?&quot;

ENERGY TIP: Actually keep a mental tally on the board or in your head. At the end, announce the &quot;winner&quot; (or the whole class wins). The competitive framing boosts participation 10x.

